  "body": "Slice 1 of 3 for #4081 (the laser profile cut). This slice adds the two kinds that the operation needs. It adds no operation and no post.\n\n## What changed\n\n- **Machine kind** (`camcraft-post`): `Kind::Laser`, declared only. The words `laser`, `laser cutter` and `laser cutting` read as the kind. A laser is an X/Y gantry with an optional focus Z. It has no spindle, no live tool, no coolant list and no rotary axis. Each broken rule is refused by its key, in the file form and in the saved-project form.\n- **One door law for the two X/Y gantries**: the waterjet and the laser share `no_spindle::xy_gantry_refusals` and `Machine::xy_gantry_sane`. The waterjet sentences do not change.\n- **Tool kind** (`camcraft-tools`): `ToolKind::Laser`, the laser head. `diameter` is the beam kerf, rpm is 0, and it has no corner radius. A laser head has no cutting data rows: the operation will state the power and the feed (slice 2). `camcraft_tools::laser::laser_tool(kerf)`.\n- **App**:\n  - The project file reads and writes the tool kind `laser`.\n  - The editor validator and the blank draft know the machine kind.\n  - No family admits a laser yet. The create gate refuses each operation by name: \"the setup's machine is a laser cutter, which cuts only laser operations\". The program check says \"<op>: a laser machine admits only laser operations\".\n  - No built-in post serves a laser.\n  - The unknown-kind sentence lists `laser`.\n- **UI**:\n  - The machine editor's Kind combo and the Machines pane's kind filter offer `laser`.\n  - The tool tables name the laser head.\n  - New original glyph `assets/ui/svg/tool-laser.svg`: a solid head, a thin beam and a burst on the sheet. `cargo xtask icons` rasterised it, and no other PNG changed.\n  - The New Tool combo does not offer the laser head yet, because no operation accepts it.\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/4081-laser-kinds.md` (what is chosen, and why the laser head has no recipe rows yet).\n- Guide: `site/content/guide/set-up/setups.md` names the kind.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nThe Machines pane's kind filter, open (the only change that shows):\n\n| Before | After |\n|---|---|\n| ![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4081/before-kind-filter.png) | ![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4081/after-kind-filter.png) |\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `camcraft-post` lib, `machine::laser::tests` (5): the kind words, an X/Y laser with and without Z, each forbidden key refused by name, the saved-project rules, the kind through the post mirror.\n- `camcraft-tools` lib, `laser::tests` (2): a good laser head; rpm, kerf, corner radius and rows refused by name.\n- `crates/app/tests/machine/laser_kind.rs` (in the `machine` directory suite, no new binary, 4 tests): the validator, the blank draft and the posts, the tool door and the project round trip, the family gate and the program check.\n- `tool_law::no_orphan_tool_kinds`: every operation refuses a laser head (slice 2 changes this to \"only the Laser Profile\").\n- Updated: `tool_sanity_tests` (the new kind in the sweep), `plasma_machine::an_unknown_kind_is_still_refused` and `machine_library::other_stated_values_refuse_by_name` (the sentence), `machines_pane::the_kind_filter_offers_every_machine_kind_and_filters_its_rows`.\n\n## Gates\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 401 steps, 1 failed (`plasma_machine`: it used `laser` as the unknown kind word). After the fix: `plasma_machine` 6/6, `machine_library` 17/17, `machine` 61/61, ui lib `machines_pane machine_editor machine_mode` 31/31.\n- `cargo clippy --no-deps --all-targets -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No laser operation and no laser post exist yet (slices 2 and 3).\n- No heavy lane: the change adds kinds and their doors, no geometry.\n\nChangelog: Machines: a `laser` machine kind and a laser head tool kind (no laser operation yet).\n\nRefs #4081\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
